{"pageid": 1429, "title": "Fall of the House of Slaughter 1", "revid": 2969, "categories": ["Comics", "Fall of the House of Slaughter comics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Fall of the House of Slaughter #1</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b8/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260321235024\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 1 A Cover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b8/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260321235024\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b8/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20260321235024 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/b/b8/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1_A_Cover.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20260321235024 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 1 A Cover\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_1_A_Cover.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter 1 A Cover.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"writer\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Tate Brombal (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGF0ZV9Ccm9tYmFsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Tate Brombal</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Adriano Turtulici (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWRyaWFub19UdXJ0dWxpY2k/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Adriano Turtulici</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">May 6, 2026</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Fall of the House of Slaughter</i> #1</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that will be published on May 6, 2026 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the first issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Fall_of_the_House_of_Slaughter_(comic_series)\" title=\"Fall of the House of Slaughter (comic series)\">Fall of the House of Slaughter</a></i> comic series.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<p>TBA\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"5c8c3a5520e9328795e05138bd95a611\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-galler